---
export const prerender = true;
import '@fontsource/geist-sans/latin-400.css';
import '@fontsource/geist-sans/latin-500.css';
import '@fontsource/geist-mono/latin-400.css';
import '@fontsource/instrument-serif/latin-400.css';
const repo = 'https://github.com/mrlemoos/Act';
const features = [
 {id:'screenplay', tab:'Screenplay', title:'Stay with the scene.', text:'A native Fountain editor that gives your words room. Jump between scenes, adjust the page to your taste and export a screenplay PDF when it is time to share.', points:['Plain-text Fountain files', 'Scene outline and writing settings', 'Screenplay PDF export'], image:'screenplay'},
 {id:'board', tab:'Board', title:'Make room for the messy part.', text:'Put drafts, scene cards and loose thoughts on a canvas. Gather them into groups. Move the pieces around until the story starts to make sense.', points:['A pannable, zoomable project canvas', 'Linked drafts, scene cards and notes', 'Your layout never rewrites your script'], image:'board'},
 {id:'shots', tab:'Shot list', title:'See it before you shoot it.', text:'Plan coverage beside the scene. Build a shot list yourself, or ask a local model for a first pass and make it yours. Your screenplay stays untouched.', points:['Scene-by-scene shot planning', 'Optional offline AI on Apple Silicon', 'Separate shot-list files'], image:'shots'},
 {id:'characters', tab:'Characters', title:'Put a face to the name.', text:'Mark character introductions as you write. Extract physical details locally, refine a reference-sheet prompt and keep earlier image versions as the character develops.', points:['Character marks linked to action paragraphs', 'Local physical-detail extraction', 'Approved image requests through your connected agent'], image:'characters'},
];
const title = 'Act | Write the scene. Plan the film.';
const description = 'A native macOS app for screenwriters. Write in Fountain, organise your project on a board, plan shots and create character reference sheets.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description} />
<link rel="canonical" href="https://mrlemoos.dev/act" /><link rel="icon" href="/act/icon.png" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#e9eaf2" />
<meta property="og:title" content={title} /><meta property="og:description" content={description} /><meta property="og:type" content="website" /><meta property="og:url" content="https://mrlemoos.dev/act" /><meta property="og:image" content="https://mrlemoos.dev/act/screenplay.png" /><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header><a class="brand" href="/act" aria-label="Act home"><img src="/act/icon.png" width="36" height="36" alt="" />Act<span>For the film in your head.</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#workspaces">Explore Act</a><a class="small-cta" href={repo}>Get Act <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">SCREENWRITING & FILM PLANNING · macOS</p><h1>Write the scene.<br /><em>Plan the film.</em></h1><div class="intro"><p>The first line. The face you imagined.<br />The shot that makes it work.<br />One place to work it out.</p><div><a class="button" href={repo}>Meet your next screenplay <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="compat">Native to Mac. Yours in Fountain.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="hero-stage"><span class="margin-note">INT. YOUR NEXT FILM — DAY</span><figure class="hero-window"><div class="window-bar"><span class="dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>A new beginning.fountain</span><span>Act</span></div><img src="/act/screenplay.png" width="1865" height="1312" alt="Act's Screenplay tab with formatted Fountain dialogue and a marked character introduction" fetchpriority="high" /></figure><span class="stage-caption">FADE IN. <span>A blank page, with somewhere to go.</span></span><span class="pencil-note">It starts here.</span></div>
</section>
<div class="manifesto"><p>Your script is a file.<br /><em>Keep it that way.</em></p><div><p>Act works with plain-text Fountain. Your screenplay, shot lists and character library stay in separate files, so planning the film never overwrites the writing.</p><a href={`${repo}#readme`}>Read how Act works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
<section id="workspaces" class="workspaces"><div class="section-top"><p class="eyebrow">THE WRITING. THE THINKING. THE PLANNING.</p><h2>Same story.<br /><em>More ways into it.</em></h2></div><nav class="workspace-nav" aria-label="Workspaces">{features.map(f=><a href={`#${f.id}`}>{f.tab}</a>)}</nav>
{features.map((f, i)=><article id={f.id} class:list={['feature', {reverse:i%2===1}]}><div class="feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">{f.tab}</p><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>{f.text}</p><ul>{f.points.map(p=><li>{p}</li>)}</ul>{f.id==='characters' && <p class="fine">Image generation uses your connected external agent. You approve each request; provider charges may apply.</p>}</div><figure class={`feature-image ${f.id}`}><img src={`/act/${f.image}.png`} width="1865" height="1312" alt={`Act ${f.tab} workspace`} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>{f.tab} / Act for macOS</figcaption></figure></article>)}
</section>
<section class="local"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR MAC. YOUR PROCESS.</p><h2>Work where<br /><em>the words are.</em></h2><div class="local-details"><p>Write and organise locally. Optional shot suggestions and physical-detail extraction run on your Mac with configured models. Image generation only leaves the machine when you approve a request.</p><p>Made for macOS 15 or later.<br />Local AI requires additional model setup.<br />Interface available in seven locales.</p></div></section>
<section class="closing"><img src="/act/icon.png" width="80" height="80" alt="Act app icon" /><h2>Give that film<br /><em>a first draft.</em></h2><a class="button" href={repo}>Get Act on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p>Source, setup and build instructions.</p></section>
</main><footer><a href="/">Leonardo Lemos</a><span>Act. Written on a Mac. Made for a film.</span><a href={repo}>GitHub ↗</a></footer>
</body></html>
<style>
:root{font-family:'Geist Sans',sans-serif;color:#202431;background:#e9eaf2;font-synthesis:none;--ink:#202431;--muted:#5c6272;--blue:#354bc1;--paper:#fafaf7}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:90px}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:5px}header{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:26px 5%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:25px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-1px}.brand img{border-radius:9px}.brand span{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0;margin-left:22px;color:var(--muted)}nav{display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center;font-size:13px}.small-cta{border:1px solid #b9bdcc;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:30px}.small-cta:hover{background:var(--paper)}.hero-copy{max-width:1240px;margin:90px auto 60px;padding:0 5%}.eyebrow{font:11px 'Geist Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}h1,h2,h3{font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.065em;line-height:.96}h1{font-size:clamp(70px,9.4vw,140px);margin:28px 0 35px}em{font-family:'Instrument Serif',serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.045em;color:var(--blue)}.intro{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px}.intro>p{font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted)}.button{display:inline-flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px;padding:19px 25px;background:var(--ink);color:white;border-radius:5px;font-size:14px;transition:background .2s,transform .2s}.button:hover{background:var(--blue);transform:translateY(-2px)}.compat{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:13px}.hero-stage{position:relative;padding:55px max(6%,calc((100vw - 1200px)/2)) 30px;background:#bfc6e2;overflow:hidden}.margin-note,.stage-caption{font:10px 'Geist Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:1px}.margin-note{display:block;margin-bottom:24px}.hero-window{margin:0;position:relative;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 25px 65px #29345c35;transform:rotate(-1deg);background:#fff}.window-bar{height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#f5f5f5;padding:0 14px;font-size:9px;color:#676767}.dots{display:flex;gap:5px}.dots i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#d7d7d7}.hero-window>img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;max-height:650px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top}.stage-caption{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:28px}.pencil-note{position:absolute;right:3%;top:48%;font:italic 32px 'Instrument Serif',serif;writing-mode:vertical-rl;color:#354bc1}.manifesto{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;padding:110px 5%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:90px}.manifesto>p{font-size:46px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-2px}.manifesto div p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.manifesto a{display:inline-block;margin-top:25px;font-size:13px;border-bottom:1px solid #8c92a6;padding-bottom:5px}.workspaces{background:var(--paper);padding:100px 5% 35px}.section-top,.workspace-nav,.feature{max-width:1240px;margin:auto}.section-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.section-top .eyebrow{padding-top:12px}h2{font-size:clamp(52px,6vw,84px)}.workspace-nav{padding:50px 0 25px;border-bottom:1px solid #d9dce4;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.workspace-nav a{border:1px solid #d9dce4;border-radius:30px;padding:10px 20px}.workspace-nav a:hover{background:#e9eaf2}.feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:65px;align-items:center;padding:90px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9dce4;scroll-margin-top:10px}.feature:last-child{border:0}.feature.reverse{grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr}.reverse .feature-copy{order:2}.feature h3{font-size:clamp(40px,4vw,61px);line-height:1.03;margin:22px 0}.feature-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted)}ul{padding:0;list-style:none;margin:25px 0 0}li{font-size:12px;padding:11px 0;border-top:1px solid #dddfe5}li:before{content:'+';font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;margin-right:12px;color:var(--blue)}.feature-copy>p.fine{font-size:11px;margin-top:20px}.feature-image{margin:0;background:#dce0ec;padding:28px 22px 15px;border-radius:5px}.feature-image img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border:1px solid #d4d6df;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 8px 25px #20243112}.feature-image figcaption{font:9px 'Geist Mono',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:15px;color:var(--muted)}.board{background:#e1dfed}.shots{background:#dde5df}.characters{background:#e9dfd4}.local{background:#293657;color:#f4f4f0;padding:90px max(5%,calc((100vw - 1240px)/2))}.local .eyebrow{color:#b8c4e0}.local h2{margin:30px 0 45px}.local em{color:#bac8ff}.local-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:90px;max-width:900px;margin-left:auto}.local-details p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#c5ccdd}.local-details p+p{font-size:12px}.closing{text-align:center;padding:110px 20px}.closing img{border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:30px}.closing h2{margin-bottom:35px}.closing>p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px}footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid #cbd0df;padding:28px 5%;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.skip{position:absolute;left:15px;top:-60px;background:white;padding:12px;z-index:10}.skip:focus{top:10px}@media(min-width:1000px){.hero-copy{animation:enter .8s both}.hero-window{animation:screen 1s both}@keyframes enter{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}@keyframes screen{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px) rotate(-1deg)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) rotate(-1deg)}}}@media(max-width:700px){header{padding:20px 5%}.brand span,nav>a:first-child{display:none}.hero-copy{margin-top:55px}.hero-copy h1{font-size:clamp(64px,12vw,88px)}.intro{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:25px}.intro>p{font-size:16px}.hero-stage{padding:28px 5% 22px}.hero-window>img{min-height:270px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top left}.pencil-note{display:none}.stage-caption{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:0}.stage-caption span{max-width:180px;text-align:right}.manifesto{padding:65px 6%;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.manifesto>p{font-size:40px}.workspaces{padding:60px 6% 10px}.section-top{display:block}.section-top h2{margin-top:25px}.workspace-nav{padding-top:35px;font-size:11px;gap:7px}.workspace-nav a{padding:9px 12px}.feature,.feature.reverse{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;padding:55px 0}.reverse .feature-copy{order:0}.feature-image{padding:16px 12px 12px}.local{padding:65px 6%}.local-details{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.closing{padding:70px 20px}footer{flex-wrap:wrap}footer>span{order:3;width:100%}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
